:::'''Sampo:''' ...The chief? Of course I knew. Wildfire are mostly made up of torch and pitchfork types. How could they function without her?
:::'''Sampo:''' Not that I'm criticizing old Oleg! He's good at the heavy lifting. It's just that Wildfire needs a meticulous thinker lurking in the sha&mdash; Ahem! ...Working in the background, hehe.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} You seem to enjoy muddying the waters.
